{"module":"grammar","item":{"id":"a1-grammar-possessivartikel","level":"A1","topic":"Artikel","title":{"de":"Possessivartikel: mein, dein, sein, ihr","bn":"Possessivartikel: mein, dein, sein, ihr"},"summary":"আমার, তোমার, তার: mein/meine/meinen আর sein বনাম ihr।","sections":[{"heading":"১. Possessivartikel কী?","blocks":[{"kind":"text","text":"কোনো জিনিস কার, তা বোঝাতে এই শব্দগুলো ব্যবহার করা হয়।"},{"kind":"table","rows":[["German","English","বাংলা"],["mein","my","আমার"],["dein","your","তোমার"],["sein","his","তার (পুরুষের)"],["ihr","her","তার (নারীর)"],["unser","our","আমাদের"],["euer","your","তোমাদের"],["Ihr","your (formal)","আপনার/আপনাদের"]]},{"kind":"text","text":"যেমন:"},{"kind":"list","items":["আমার বই → mein Buch","তোমার ব্যাগ → deine Tasche","তার বাবা → sein Vater","তার মা → ihre Mutter"]}]},{"heading":"২. mein ও meine কেন আলাদা?","blocks":[{"kind":"text","text":"এখানে একটি সহজ নিয়ম আছে। Possessivartikel-এর শেষ অংশ noun-এর gender ও case অনুযায়ী বদলায়।"},{"kind":"table","rows":[["Noun","সঠিক রূপ","বাংলা"],["der Vater","mein Vater","আমার বাবা"],["die Mutter","meine Mutter","আমার মা"],["das Kind","mein Kind","আমার শিশু"],["die Kinder (plural)","meine Kinder","আমার শিশুরা"]]},{"kind":"text","text":"সহজভাবে:"},{"kind":"list","items":["Masculine: mein Vater","Feminine: meine Mutter","Neuter: mein Kind","Plural: meine Kinder"]}]},{"heading":"৩. Akkusativ হলে কী হয়?","blocks":[{"kind":"text","text":"Masculine noun-এর ক্ষেত্রে mein → meinen হয়।"},{"kind":"table","rows":[["Nominativ","Akkusativ"],["mein Vater","meinen Vater"],["meine Mutter","meine Mutter"],["mein Kind","mein Kind"],["meine Freunde","meine Freunde"]]},{"kind":"text","text":"উদাহরণ:"},{"kind":"examples","items":[{"de":"Mein Vater ist nett.","en":"My father is kind.","bn":"আমার বাবা দয়ালু।"},{"de":"Ich sehe meinen Vater.","en":"I see my father.","bn":"আমি আমার বাবাকে দেখি।"},{"de":"Das ist meine Mutter.","en":"This is my mother.","bn":"ইনি আমার মা।"},{"de":"Ich liebe meine Familie.","en":"I love my family.","bn":"আমি আমার পরিবারকে ভালোবাসি।"}]}]},{"heading":"৪. sein ও ihr-এর পার্থক্য","blocks":[{"kind":"text","text":"এটা ভালোভাবে মনে রাখবে:"},{"kind":"examples","items":[{"de":"Ali hat ein Auto. Sein Auto ist neu.","bn":"আলীর একটি গাড়ি আছে। তার গাড়িটি নতুন।"},{"de":"Sara hat ein Auto. Ihr Auto ist neu.","bn":"সারার একটি গাড়ি আছে। তার গাড়িটি নতুন।"}]},{"kind":"text","text":"এখানে sein আলীর জন্য, আর ihr সারার জন্য ব্যবহৃত হয়েছে। কোনটি ব্যবহার হবে, তা নির্ভর করে মালিকের ওপর।"}]}],"test":[{"id":"a1-grammar-possessivartikel-t1","type":"mcq","prompt":"„আমার মা“ জার্মানে কোনটি?","options":["mein Mutter","meine Mutter","meinen Mutter"],"answer":1,"explanation":"die Mutter feminine, তাই meine Mutter।"},{"id":"a1-grammar-possessivartikel-t2","type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich sehe ___ Vater. (আমার বাবাকে)","options":["meinen","mein","meine"],"answer":0,"explanation":"der Vater masculine, Akkusativ-এ mein → meinen।"},{"id":"a1-grammar-possessivartikel-t3","type":"mcq","prompt":"„Sara hat ein Auto. ___ Auto ist neu.“","options":["Sein","Dein","Ihr"],"answer":2,"explanation":"মালিক সারা (নারী), তাই ihr: Ihr Auto ist neu।"},{"id":"a1-grammar-possessivartikel-t4","type":"mcq","prompt":"„Ali hat ein Auto. ___ Auto ist neu.“","options":["Ihr","Sein","Mein"],"answer":1,"explanation":"মালিক আলী (পুরুষ), তাই sein: Sein Auto ist neu।"},{"id":"a1-grammar-possessivartikel-t5","type":"mcq","prompt":"„unser“ মানে কী?","options":["আমাদের","তোমাদের","আপনার"],"answer":0,"explanation":"unser = আমাদের। তোমাদের = euer, আপনার = Ihr।"},{"id":"a1-grammar-possessivartikel-t6","type":"mcq","prompt":"„তোমার ব্যাগ“ (die Tasche) জার্মানে কোনটি?","options":["dein Tasche","deinen Tasche","deine Tasche"],"answer":2,"explanation":"die Tasche feminine, তাই deine Tasche।"},{"id":"a1-grammar-possessivartikel-t7","type":"mcq","prompt":"„আমার শিশুরা“ জার্মানে কোনটি?","options":["mein Kinder","meinen Kinder","meine Kinder"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Plural-এ meine: meine Kinder।"},{"id":"a1-grammar-possessivartikel-t8","type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich liebe ___ Familie. (die Familie)","options":["meine","meinen","mein"],"answer":0,"explanation":"die Familie feminine, Akkusativ-এও meine থাকে।"}]},"schema":1,"id":"a1-grammar-possessivartikel","level":"A1","test":[{"id":"a1-grammar-possessivartikel-t1","type":"mcq","prompt":"„আমার মা“ জার্মানে কোনটি?","options":["mein Mutter","meine Mutter","meinen Mutter"],"answer":1,"explanation":"die Mutter feminine, তাই meine Mutter।"},{"id":"a1-grammar-possessivartikel-t2","type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich sehe ___ Vater. (আমার বাবাকে)","options":["meinen","mein","meine"],"answer":0,"explanation":"der Vater masculine, Akkusativ-এ mein → meinen।"},{"id":"a1-grammar-possessivartikel-t3","type":"mcq","prompt":"„Sara hat ein Auto. ___ Auto ist neu.“","options":["Sein","Dein","Ihr"],"answer":2,"explanation":"মালিক সারা (নারী), তাই ihr: Ihr Auto ist neu।"},{"id":"a1-grammar-possessivartikel-t4","type":"mcq","prompt":"„Ali hat ein Auto. ___ Auto ist neu.“","options":["Ihr","Sein","Mein"],"answer":1,"explanation":"মালিক আলী (পুরুষ), তাই sein: Sein Auto ist neu।"},{"id":"a1-grammar-possessivartikel-t5","type":"mcq","prompt":"„unser“ মানে কী?","options":["আমাদের","তোমাদের","আপনার"],"answer":0,"explanation":"unser = আমাদের। তোমাদের = euer, আপনার = Ihr।"},{"id":"a1-grammar-possessivartikel-t6","type":"mcq","prompt":"„তোমার ব্যাগ“ (die Tasche) জার্মানে কোনটি?","options":["dein Tasche","deinen Tasche","deine Tasche"],"answer":2,"explanation":"die Tasche feminine, তাই deine Tasche।"},{"id":"a1-grammar-possessivartikel-t7","type":"mcq","prompt":"„আমার শিশুরা“ জার্মানে কোনটি?","options":["mein Kinder","meinen Kinder","meine Kinder"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Plural-এ meine: meine Kinder।"},{"id":"a1-grammar-possessivartikel-t8","type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich liebe ___ Familie. (die Familie)","options":["meine","meinen","mein"],"answer":0,"explanation":"die Familie feminine, Akkusativ-এও meine থাকে।"}]}